  "description": "Temporarily transforms the Umbraco backoffice into a festive experience during date ranges you choose. Eight themes (Christmas, Halloween, New Year, Diwali, Valentine's Day, Easter, St Patrick's Day, Thanksgiving), each with its own subtle background effect, an occasional themed cameo, and a celebratory toast on publish. Run a single theme for one occasion, or plan the whole year ahead with a schedule that switches itself over. Backoffice only, off by default, and it never touches your content or your front end.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "FestiveUmbraco",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-17T13:06:54.553Z",
